{"authorDailyContributionsMap":{"Vanillajohn":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"727ad7d501c40d14c07cdbad96e976a9c818ab4e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Aidan\u0027s Photo","messageBody":"There is no photo for this user.\n\nThis will not meet the week\u0027s requirements\n\nLet\u0027s add this photo and the changes made in the AboutUs page to\ncircumvent that.\n\nTHis will then meet this week\u0027s requirements.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"3e738641c5acd9de7ae75fd2e749bf0a3a31e5c8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Site Settings and part of the DG","messageBody":"Tutoria still refers to AB3 in parts of its site settings, and does not\nreflect our user stories and some use cases for Tutoria.\n\nThis mismatch of information will confuse future users of Tutorias they\nwill see mentions of AB3, or non-Tutoria related information.\n\nLet\u0027s update any mentions of AB3 in the site settings, update the user\nstories in the Deevloper\u0027s guide to match those of our own, and add\nsome relevant use cases.\n\nThis will update our site settings and developer guide to be more\nrelevant to Tutoria than with AB3.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"other":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"docs":{"insertions":68,"deletions":12}}},{"hash":"dca7ad40223e6939f501d9999cbafae6b6de75ae","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #22 from Vanillajohn/branch-updateSiteWideSettingsAndPartOfDG","messageBody":"Update Site Settings and part of the DG","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"6f45b99649f774e3925f095611c1281947ce880f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Search command functionality","messageBody":"The user presently can only find contacts by name and not details.\n\nThis is not helpful since tutors may remark students with \"deficient in\nmath\" or \"monitor closely\" and want to find those particular students,\nhence needing a way to search all of a contact\u0027s aattributes.\n\nLet\u0027s add a Search command that will go through all of the present\nattributes in a Person class (Name, Address, Email, Tags and Phone) by\nmaking similar classes to the Find command, and making a predicate that\nchecks all attributes.\n\nThis serves as a stepping stone by seeing what is possible at the app\u0027s\nbase stage, and will allow the user to find contacts based on any\nattribute.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":150,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"4b36a703c603b1705cbf51460602ba47947a2009","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into add-basic-search-functionality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"05e8caa4e2a8543483597b2c9efbc625dbf8092d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add basic search functionality","messageBody":"The user presently can only find contacts by name and not details.\n\nThis is not helpful since tutors may remark students with \"deficient in\nmath\" or \"monitor closely\" and want to find those particular students,\nhence needing a way to search all of a contact\u0027s aattributes.\n\nLet\u0027s add a Search command that will go through all of the present\nattributes in a Person class (Name, Address, Email, Tags and Phone) by\nmaking similar classes to the Find command, and making a predicate that\nchecks all attributes. This cannot search for student\u0027s grades or subjects,\nbut that will be added in future commits.\n\nThis serves as a stepping stone by seeing what is possible at the app\u0027s\nbase stage, and will allow the user to find contacts based on any\nattribute.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"c216d61fddd1c10699cf63a735148f954fd999a8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #35 from Vanillajohn/add-basic-search-functionality","messageBody":"Add basic search functionality\nCodecov issue is that unit tests were not done for the new things added. Will be changed in future PR.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"euanlt":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e38a20c519843cf5d69cea5e839217da2d18543e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update About Us page","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"f60c277a902bf7094b4c3ec4542fff9a68ef928a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #12 from PranavJ-960/add-pranav-photo","messageBody":"Add profile photo and details for Pranav","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"eaa2e023f73a921138f383f40320856b3ea23e38","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #11 from Vanillajohn/branch-addPhoto","messageBody":"Add Aidan\u0027s Photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"8cf6c77223ce6c65d3a0e92f498a8bcabb5ddd99","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update project website homepage","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"9b7d8b1c8bc51cffe6360645e048655e439a2349","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #30 from euanlt/update-project-website","messageBody":"Update project website homepage","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"5d9d5e7b266f7c7dce52a9cce7126b63c3f29426","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add basic functionality for parents","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":662,"deletions":11}}},{"hash":"bcb7b9c7a2815f81fa3a0f9c551c5c3defe4a327","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix checkstyle issues","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":304,"deletions":114}}},{"hash":"7eb67d88b91d213e303c713bdecfb12204dadf96","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix parent card formatting issues","messageB